    "before": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "j180",
        "title": "T41: the page layout's Theming playground sets width: 100% on its <ui-page-layout>:  without it the layout drew 0 wide, its page text one word a line -- the playground lays its preview out in a wrapping row, and a layout sizes itself from its own width (a container query), so it has none to give;  Spell UI's own docs page (/components/ui/ui-page-layout.html, Theming) still has that bug, filed as an issue",
        "status": "open",
        "state": "open",
        "changed": "2026-11-16T13:00:39-05:00",
